      "html": "<section class=\"ds-pane\"><h2>Nội dung bài học</h2><p>Đọc câu hỏi và đối chiếu bằng chứng.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-pane{font:400 14px/1.7 var(--sans);color:var(--text);background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:25px}.ds-pane h2{font:600 20px/1.6 var(--sans);color:var(--ink);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 15px}.ds-pane p{margin:0}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lesson Stage",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "lesson-stage-selected",
      "description": "Five direct stage destinations; checks reflect self-marked study completion, not correctness.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-stages\" aria-label=\"Lesson stages\"><button aria-current=\"step\"><span>1</span>Lý thuyết</button><button><span>2</span>Hướng dẫn làm bài</button><button><span>3</span>Bài tập nhỏ</button><button><span>4</span>Bài tập đầy đủ</button><button><span>5</span>Đáp án &amp; xem lại</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-stages{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;font-family:var(--sans)}.ds-stages button{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-align:left;padding:12px 10px;min-height:44px;border:1px solid #bac5d6;border-radius:5px;background:var(--sheet);color:var(--ink);font:500 11px/1.6 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}.ds-stages button span{display:grid;place-items:center;flex-shrink:0;width:23px;height:23px;background:#e7ecf5;border-radius:4px}.ds-stages button[aria-current]{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--tint);color:#1c47b8}.ds-stages button[aria-current] span{background:var(--accent);color:white}.ds-stages button:hover{border-color:#8b9dbc}.ds-stages button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #638dff;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-stages{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}.ds-stages button{min-height:49px;padding:10px}.ds-stages button:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source Section and Notebook",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Native source disclosure with saved exercise notes; model answers open only by learner action.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-source\" open><summary>E1. Bài tập nhỏ</summary><div class=\"ds-source-body\"><p>Read the source task and save your response for review.</p><label for=\"ds-notes\">Exercise notes: E1</label><textarea id=\"ds-notes\" rows=\"5\"></textarea><small>Saved on this device. Compare in the review stage.</small></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-source{font:400 14px/1.95 var(--sans);color:var(--text);padding:17px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.ds-source summary{font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;cursor:pointer;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-source summary:hover{color:var(--accent)}.ds-source summary:focus-visible,.ds-source textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #638dff;outline-offset:4px}.ds-source-body{padding-top:18px;min-width:0}.ds-source-body p{max-width:75ch;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-source label{display:block;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:19px;margin:25px 0 11px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}.ds-source textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:400 14px/1.7 var(--sans);background:white;color:var(--text);border:1px solid #b5c1d2;border-radius:5px;padding:11px 12px;resize:vertical}.ds-source textarea:hover{border-color:#8b9dbc}.ds-source small{display:block;margin-top:11px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-source{font-size:13px;line-height:2}.ds-source summary{font-size:13px}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Technical Field Manual",
    "overview": "Hiên is a practical IELTS workspace for Vietnamese university students, primarily in technology-related majors. Graphite navigation, cool white workspaces, cobalt actions, and compact sans-serif headings make study tasks easy to locate and complete. Audience relevance comes from clarity and useful information, without gender stereotypes.\n\nThe interface uses direct Vietnamese instructions alongside English learning material. Fine dividers, labeled steps, and reference panes support deliberate practice and evidence review. The implementation in `src/theme.css`, `src/main.tsx`, and `src/App.tsx` defines this system.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Graphite navigation and white workspaces on a cool neutral background.",
      "One sans-serif family with clear task hierarchy and measured density.",
      "Flat lists, explicit states, and study information derived from actual work.",
      "Source-led lessons use five direct stages, native disclosures, and persistent exercise notes within the existing field-manual workspace."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The State Evidence Rule",
        "body": "Use color alongside a visible label or explanation; color alone never communicates study results.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Family Rule",
        "body": "Use Be Vietnam Pro for both learning material and interface chrome; preserve Vietnamese glyph coverage.",
        "section": "typography"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use graphite navigation, cool white workspaces, cobalt actions, and clear sans-serif hierarchy.",
      "Do keep selected, saved, submitted, and error states explicit in text and semantics.",
      "Do preserve keyboard focus, readable learning material, and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do derive study counts and progress from actual activity and saved work.",
      "Do label learner-marked stage completion separately from assessed answer correctness."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't reintroduce botanical imagery, literary serif styling, motivational slogans, or decorative code.",
      "Don't turn flat study indexes into floating decorative card collections.",
      "Don't invent analytics, official endorsement, or automated band scores.",
      "Don't use decorative artwork or generated copy as learning evidence.",
      ""
    ]
  }
}
